    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90290" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσῠφαίνω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i>
		aor.
		inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νφᾶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sever.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				13.17
			</span></i>:—<i>interweave with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθανάτῳ θνητόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					41d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sever.
			</span></i> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀκόλουθον τῇ γραφῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.511
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				536
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Gal.</u>
				178b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινόν τι τοῖς ἀρχαίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					26.316a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσυφάνθη τὸ χόριον</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ς <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώματι</span></span>) <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				32
			</span></i>: metaph. of buildings, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίας
				προσυφαίνουσι ταῖς γωνίαις</span> (in a painting) <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				2.28
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοαὶ] αἷς ἱππόδρομός τε προσύφανται
					καὶ θέατρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					11.218
				</span></i>
			.</div>
